<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Sagala Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 VAKOLINDO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluva ya kavili ya Mtumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Kol</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluva ya kavili ya Mutumi Pawulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">VAKOLINDO</para>
  <para style="imt">Wulongolo</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndongwa tsotsili mu chitabu chino</para>
  <para style="ip">Tun'wona kuta! Chitabu chino cha kavili cha Vakolindo chandikwe na mutumi Pawulo ha mwaka gwa 55 na 56 hoavaga mwanga aleliche Chilisito mu sula ya 1:1. Yino yo baluva ya kavili hagati ha tsila tso tunatso tso tsandikwe na Pawulo kwa chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito cha Vakolindo. Vasomi vantumba kuta lwavaga lulutye luvala ludodo hela luhuma hala Pawulo hoavaga avandichilye Vakolindo baluva nalamu ya kuvang'anulila. Tulihela nambe hono hohave ho handikwe ha baluva iyo yo anguyitambula mutumi Pawulo mu sula ya 2:3-4, ila tunhotsa kuta yikuva avandichilye hala hoavaga ku Machedoniya, lave mu sula ya 2:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluva ya Vakolindo va kavili yo baluva ya wiyeka, kwasawuli yinlonga ndongwa tsa mwene Pawulo hamwe na hila fyo aganaga mwene. Pawulo anlonga hila wuhechelelo wake fyowuli kwasawuli ya ndongwa tsa chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito cha Vakolindo tso avaga atsihuliche kuhuma kwa Tito. Mugati mwa baluva yino tungugapata madahitso ganya mugati ga ndongwa tsa wutawulaji kota mahotso ga Lilagano Lipya, hono iho Pawulo anguvalajitsa vanu vasoje finu kwasawuli ya vayawo wovali ku Yelusalemu, lave mu sula ya 8, 9. Kaha yinhotswa kuta vamwe va vatumi va wudesi wo vavaga siyo va chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito cha Vakolindo vavadisile vanu vamuvipile Pawulo, ili vene vave vatambulwa. Vaganaga kuvadita vanu valeche kumutumba Pawulo na vamuwone Pawulo kuta siyo mutumi va Chilisito. Lulongwa ulo lwamudisile Pawulo andiche kuwudugo wa baluva yino bila kuvafiha kuta mwene anago mamulaka makomi ga chitume mugati mwa Chilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fyofili mu baluva yino</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo ankwantsa baluva yake kwa kuchilamusa chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito mu sula ya 1:1-7.</para>
  <para style="io">Pawulo anguvalonjela hila fyo abadilise mipanjo jake ja lujendo, anguvalonjela hila fyo anuchye ndongwa tsawo na kuta atselite kuta vanuchilye yila baluva yake ndongola mu sula ya 1:8-7:16.</para>
  <para style="io">Hambele Pawulo anlajitsa kuta, chikundi cha vanu wo vamutumbye Chilisito cha Vakolindo chin'ganika chisoje magobole ili kuvatanga vayawo va ku Yelusalemu mu sula ya 8:1-9:15.</para>
  <para style="io">Muwudugo Pawulo angipamana kwa kuvalonjela kuta mwene mutumi, kaha anguvalonjela lula lujendo lwake lwa habehi lo akujenda mu sula ya 10:1-13:10.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Baluva yino yinhuma kwa heni Pawulo, yo nyagulwe kota fyo aganile Mulungu ili ntsive mutumi va Yesu Chilisito, tulihamwe na mung'olotsangu Timoseyo tunguvalamusa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 1:1">Ntsinguvandichila vanu chikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito chochili ku Kolindo na kwa vanu veka wo vali ku Akaya wo vahagulwe na Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Tungumusuka Mulungu va Dada vetu munya wuvetso na Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito avawonele lusungu na kuvapelani wusichimafu.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo angumulumba Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Atsumitswaje Mulungu yo Dada va Mutwa vetu Yesu Chilisito, yo Dada munya lusungu na yo atupelaga wukangatso. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Mulungu yo atukangatsaga hetwe mu ng'odeko tsetu, ili na hetwe tuvakangatse vanu vanji wo vali mu ng'odeko yoyive kwa wukangatso wuwulaga wo twanuchilaga hetwe kuhuma kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kota hila ng'odeko tso tungutsipata kwasawuli ya kumutumba Chilisito fyo tsinkongetseka, na hihyo wukangatso wa Chilisito fyo wunlutila kuva wukomi. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Manyi hetwe tuve tunkodeka, yinkuva ihyo kwasawuli ya kuvakangatsa henye mu wukuluso wenyu! Kaha hala hetwe ho tunkangatswa, yinkuva ihyo ili tuvakangatse henye. Ihyo ho mukudaha kwikangatsa kota hetwe fyo tungikangatsa. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Hihyo tungihuvila kuta, kota hila fyo mwihantsitse na hetwe mu ng'odeko tsetu, ho hihyo fyo mukihantsa mu wukangatso wo angutupela Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Vang'olotsetu tun'gana mutsele tsila ng'odeko tso twapasile ku inyi ya Asiya. Hila fyo twatache kulutila wuvetso wo twavaga nawo, mbaka tukagotsolaje kuva wumi. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Nachene twahotsaga kufwa hela, lechelelo tuntsela kuta ndongwa itso tsahumye ili kutudita tuleche kihuvila tuvene, ila twendelele kumutumbila Mulungu yo kutsilipulaga vanu. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Mwene Mulungu yo atukuluse chinya hila mu ng'oko yila ya chifo akwendelela kutukulusa kaha, na tungumuhuvila kuta akuwila kutukulusa. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Kota hila henye fyo mwihantsitse na hetwe ili mututanje kutusuchila kwa Mulungu, nawo vanu wolofu vakumulumba Mulungu badili ya hetwe kwasawuli ya fifunje na lusungu lo twapasile kwa kujibulwa kwa suko tsa vanu wolofu.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anleka kubita ku lujendo lwa ku Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Duve lelo, tufuluche kwidaya mu numbula tsetu kuta, twichite mu inyi na hagati henyu kwa kwika na wugolofu wo atugavye Mulungu. Hetwe twihuvye wuwuya wo wunhuma kwa Mulungu, siyo nyala tsetu tsa chiwunu hela, ihyo fyo twadisile kwa vanu na nachene twadisile kwenyu. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Tuvandichlye henye ndongwa tso mukuvetsa kutsisoma na kutsitsela. Heni ntsingihuvila kuta mukutsitsela nachene, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kwasawuli mbaka sambi mutweliwe chidogo hela. Kaha tuntsela kuta siku yo akuwuya Mutwa vetu Yesu, mukitsumila hetwe kota hihila hetwe fyo tukitsumila henye.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ntsavaga na lihuvilo kwa ndongwa itsi, na ihyo ntsaganaga kulongola kutsa kwenyu ili muve na fwayida mala kavili. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ntsavaga mantsile kuta, nguvajendela hala ho nguva mulujendo kubita ku Machedoniya na hala ho nguva ntsin'wuya. Kahi munanje mu lujendo lwangu lwa kubita ku Yudeya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mufuluche mwiputse kuta kwasawuli yachi ntsagalwe lulongwa lwangu, awu tsapantsile kota fyo valongaga vanu hela bila kuhotsa? Mbe, munhotsa kuta heni ntsinakota vanu wo valongaga, “Ena” Nawo vapitulaga luvala lulo, “Ndaya?” <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Lechelelo kota hila Mulungu fyo vakihuvilwa, na heni lulongwa lo ntsinguvalonjela silufuluche luve, “Ena” Na luvala lulo luve “Ndaya,” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />kwasawuli Yesu Chilisito, Mwana va Mulungu yo twavavikulye heni na Silifwano na Timoseyo, siavaga “Ena” Na luvala lulo luve “Ndaya,” ino kwa Mulungu siku tseka yivaga “Ena.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ihyo ndongwa tseka tso avaga alontsile Mulungu kuta akutupela kukolela kwa Chilisito tsiveye, “Ena.” Ihyo kwa mwene tunlonga, “Tavile” Kwasawuli kumutsumila Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Mwene yo Mulungu yo atuditaga hetwe hamwe na henye kwima nachene kwa kihantsa na Chilisito. Nayo atuhagwe, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />na kutuvika hetwe tuve vanu vake mwene kwa kutuvichila Muhe vake mugati mwetu ave yalama ya kuta tuli vanu vake, na tungitumbila kuta akutuditila fyeka fyo avaga lontsile kuta akutupela.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Nayo Mulungu an'tsela kuta ntsinlonga wukweli, sintsawutsile ku Kolindo ili kuvawonela henye lusungu. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Siyo kota tun'gana kuvananahitsa mu litumbilo lya Chilisito. Ila henye munkwima kwa wuvetso wenyu, lechelelo hetwe tunkola katsi hamwe na henye kwasawuli ya wuhechelelo wenyu.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ihyo tsalamwe mu numbula yangu kuta singuwila kudita lujendo lunji lo lukuvadita henye mususuvale. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ino lelo manyi ntsivasusutatse henye, nani yo akumela wuhechelelo? Si mukuva henye wo ntsivasusutise! <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ihyo ntsavandichilye baluva kota hila, ili manyi ntsitse kwenyu ndeche kususutatswa na vanu yo van'ganika vamele wuhechelelo. Ntsingihuvila nachene kuta manyi heni nyechelele, na henye nyeka munhechelela hamwe na heni. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Hala ho ntsavandichilaga ntsavaga mu ng'odeko ngomi na ng'ung'uto mu numbula na kuvemba ndalahela. Sintavandiche ili kugana mususutale, ila tsaganaga muwutsele wugano wo ntsinguvagana fyowuli wukomi.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuhulumila yo akuvifitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Lechelelo manyi kuna munu amutifitse muyage, akuva sianifitse heni ng'ani, ila akuva avatifitse na henye nyeka, heni sintsin'gana ng'alipe kulutila fyo ntsin'ganika kukalipa. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Ng'odeko yo akuva apasile kuhuma kwa vanu wolofu yikuva yimukwilye. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Lelo chiba mumuhulumile na kumuhongetsa munu uyo, ili aleche kususutala ndalahela na kugotsola nachene. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ihyo ntsinguvagongola mumulajile kaha kuta mungumugana. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ntsavandichilye baluva yinya hila ili kutsela kuta mufuluche mudichile chila chinu cho ntsinlajitsa. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Manyi henye mumuhulumile munu yoyuve, na heni ngumuhulumila. Kaha manyi ntsimuhulumile munu lulongwa loluve, duve nguva ntsimuhulumye kukolela kwa Chilisito kwasawuli ya henye nyeka, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />ili Lihoka lileche kutusuma. Kwasawuli tujitsele mipanjo mibi ja Lihoka.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo an'gaya wusichimafu uko ku Tulova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Hotsavaga kufika ku Tulova kutsivikula Ndongwa Nofu tsa Chilisito, ntsafisile Mutwa mwanga ambichye chang'ani chila chinu ili ntsiyidite katsi yake. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Lechelelo sintsavaga na wusichimafu, kwasawuli sitsamufisile uko mung'olotsangu Tito. Ihyo ngalaganaje nawo na kuwuka kubita ku Machedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusuma kukolela kwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Lechelelo alumbwaje Mulungu yo atulongwitse bila kutuleka, atulongwitse mu lujendo lwa wusumi kwa kwihantsa na Chilisito. Mwene yo atuditaga tuwutagalitse chila hono wukweli wa Chilisito kota wununyililo wunofu. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Hetwe tunakota wununyililo wunofu wo Chilisito amutawulye Mulungu, wununyililo wunofu wo wuntagalila hagati ha vanu wo vankuluswa na wo sinambevamutumbe Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Kwa vanu vala wo sinambevamutumbe Chilisito, hetwe tunkuva kota wununyililo wa chifo, lechelelo kwa vanu vala wo vankuluswa, hetwe tunkuva kota wununyililo wunofu wa wumi. Nani yo afuluche ihantse mu ndongwa kota itso? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Hetwe siyo kota vanu vanji wo vangutsivikula Ndongwa tsa Mulungu ili vapate magobole. Badili yake hetwe tungutsivikula kwa wugolofu kota vanu wo tutumilwe kuhuma kwa Mulungu, vanu yo twihantsitse kwa Chilisito.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="s">Vatantsi va Lilagano Lipya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Mbe, munhotsa kuta tunkwantsa kaha kwidutsa tuvene? Mbe, tun'ganika kaha tuve na baluva ya kutudita tudichilwe na henye awu kuhuma kwa henye kota vanu vanji fyo van'dita? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Henye vene yo baluva yetu yo yandikwe mu numbula yetu, yo yin'tselanika na kusomwa na chila munu. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Henye mwanga mungitambutsa chang'ani kuta wo baluva yo yihumye kwa Chilisito, kaha henye wo wulajilo wa katsi yetu yo siyandikwe kwa wino ila yandikwe na Muhe va Mulungu yo Mumi, baluva yo siyandikwe mu fipande fila fya maganga ila yandikwe mu numbula tsa vanu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Tunlonga ndongwa itso kwasawuli ya wukangatso wo tunawo kwa Mulungu kukolela kwa ndongwa tso atuditye Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Hetwe sinambetuhotse kuta tufuluche tuludite lulongwa loluve tuvene, lechelelo tuhotsaga kuta wuvetso wetu wuhumaga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Mulungu yo atutangaga hetwe kuva vatantsi va Lilagano Lipya lyo silinakota mandiko gala go gandikwe na Musa, ila lilagano lyo lyandikwe na Muhe va Mulungu. Malajitsto go gandikwe na Musa gakopolaga, ila Muhe va Mulungu aletaga wumi.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Malajitso ga Musa galetitwe kwa kwandikwa mu fipande fya maganga na galetitwe kwa wumelemo. Nayivaje hambele yaletite chifo, ila wumelemo wake wavaga wukomi ndalahela mbaka vana Vaisilaheli valemulwe kuchilava chihanga cha Musa. Kaha hambele wumelemo wula wukasilaje. Manyi yive malajitso ga Musa go gambutsaga chifo galetitwe chinya kumelema, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />mbe, wukuva ndawuli wuvina wa katsi ya Muhe va Mulungu? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Manyi wutantsi wula wulongola wo wavahigaga vanu wavaga na wumelemo, mbe, yino yo yin'dita vanu vadichilwe na Mulungu siyikuva na wuvina hilo nda? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ino lelo wutantsi wula wulongola wa Lilagano lya Katali wo wavaga na wumelemo manyi uwiganitse na wuvina wa Lilagano Lipya, wula wukuwoneka kuta wumelemo wake wusisile. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Ihyo manyi chila cho chayagaga hela chavaga na wumelemo, mbe, chino cha sambi cho chinsigala siku tseka si chikulutila wuvina?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ihyo lelo kwasawuli ya lihuvilo lyo tunalyo, tunawo wukangatso wukomi. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Hetwe situn'dita kota Musa yo aganikaga kugubika kumiho kwake kwa chitambala ili vana Vaisilaheli valeche kuwuwona wumelemo wo avaga nawo nayivaje hambele wayagaga. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Lechelelo nyala tsa Vaisilaheli tsayuganitswaga. Mbaka sambi ho linsomwa Lilagano lya Katali nyala tsawo tsigubikwaga na chitambala chila. Ila hala manyi munu ihantse na Chilisito, nyala tsawo tsigubulwaga. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Mbaka munyi guno hala Malajitso ga Musa ho gansomwa, nyala tsawo tsigubikwaga na chitambala icho. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Lechelelo hala ho vangumupituchila Mutwa Mulungu, nyala tsawo tsigubulwaga. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Duve, kwa ndongwa itso, “Mutwa” Yo Muhe va Mulungu. Ihyo hono hoali Muhe va Mulungu, iho ho hana wuhulu. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Duve hetwe tweka wo kumiho kwetu ko sikugubikwe na tunguwuwona wumelemo wa Mutwa kota chiwowo fyo chilajilaga. Hetwe natwe tun'badilwa ili twihwane nayo, kuhuma wuvina mbaka wuvina wukomi hilo wo wunhuma kwa Mutwa yo Muhe va Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Hachiba tsa Chimuhe mu fitumbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ihyo lelo, Mulungu kwa lusungu lwake atupelye wutantsi wuno, na ihyo situkujela tugotsole. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Tutsilesile nachene ndongwa tsa nyoni na tsa wufiho, kaha sinambetwikale kwa kutsidita ndongwa tsa wudesi, na sinambe tuhantse Ndongwa tsa Mulungu na wudesi. Ila kwa kulonga wukweli tungilajila kuta tudichilwe, ihyo fyo vanu vafuluche vatsele kuta hetwe tuli vanu va chinyandawuli halutalo ha Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Lechelelo manyi tsive Ndongwa Nofu tso tunvikula tsifihite, duve tsikuva tsifihite kwa vanu vala wo sinambevamutumbe Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Vanu iwo sinambevatsitumbe Ndongwa Nofu, kwasawuli Lihoka litsibofolantsile nyala tsawo, ili valeche kuguwona mwangatsa gwa Ndongwa Nofu tsa wuvina wa Chilisito yo sula yake Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Ino lelo sinambe twivikule tuvene, ila tungumuvikula Yesu Chilisito kuta yo Mutwa, na hetwe yo vatantsi venyu kwasawuli ya mwene. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ihyo Mulungu yo alontsile, “Mwangatsa gung'alikaje mu jitsa,” uyo yo mwangatsa go gung'alikaga mu numbula tsetu, nayo uyo yo atupelelye mwangatsa gwa ntselo ya wumelemo wake mu sula ya Chilisito.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ino lelo hetwe yo tuli kota fitumbe fyo fifuluche fituliche chipefu hela, tuvisilwe hachiba tsa Chimuhe mugati mwetu, ili yitselaniche kuta wuvetso wuno wukomi siwun'huma kwa hetwe ila wunhuma kwa mwene Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Tun'kodeka kwa ndongwa ntsolofu lechelelo sinambe tulemwe, tumpata muhwehwe lechelelo sinambe tugotsole, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />tun'kodwa lechelelo sinambetulechwe na Mulungu, kaha tun'totswa hasi lechelelo sinambealeche kututanga. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Chila siku van'gana kutukopola kota fyo vamukopwe Yesu, ili wumi wa Yesu wuwoneche mu mivili jetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Kwakuva luvala luno ho tunkuva wumi, siku tseka vanu van'gana kutukopola kwasawuli ya Yesu, ili wumi wake Yesu wuwoneche mu mivili jetu jino jo jifwaga. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ihyo lelo hetwe tunkodeka na kuva habehi na kutajika, lechelelo henye munguwupata wumi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Yandikwe mu Mandiko ga Mulungu kuta, “Ntsimutumbite Mulungu na kwasawuli iyo ntsalontsile.” Hetwe natwe tunayo numbula yiyo ya kitumbila, tuntumbila na kwasawuli iyo tunlonga. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Tuntsela kuta Mulungu yula yo amutsilipwe Mutwa Yesu, yo akututsilipula na hetwe kota fyo amutsilipwe Yesu na akutuvika halutalo hake hamwe na henye. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ndongwa tseka tsino tsili kwasawuli yenyu, ihyo lusungu lwa Mulungu luntawulwa na vanu wolofu na kunkuva na ndumbo ngomi, nayo Mulungu ampata ntsumilo ntsolofu ndalahela.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kikala kwa litumbilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Kwa ihyo sinambetugotsole. Nayivaje mivili jetu jinsakala, ila mugati mwetu tun'ditwa wupya chila siku. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Ng'odeko tsetu ndodo na ya luvala ludodo hela, tsingutuvichila chang'ani ntsumitso tsa siku tseka bila wudugo tso ngomi kulutila ng'odeko tsetu. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Ihyo sinambetufihuvile finu fyo fin'woneka, lechelelo tungihuvila finu fyo sinambefiwoneche, kwasawuli finu fila fyo fin'woneka ifyo fivaga fya luvala ludodo hela, lechelelo finu fila fyo sinambefiwoneche, ifyo fivaga fya siku tseka.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Tun'tsela kuta muvili gwetu guno gwa muinyi go tungikala nago go gunakota chuwo ho gukuva kwanangwa, Mulungu akutupela nyumba kula Kilanga go muvili gwa kikala nago siku tseka, muvili go sigutsentsilwe na mawoko ga vanu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ino sambi ho tungikala hano ha inyi tun'guta kwa wusungu, kuno tungiwiniwa kwa lihuvilo likomi kupata jila mivili mipya jojili kilanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Nachene ho kukufwala mivili ja Kilanga chinya ihyo, situkuwoneka kuta tuli mwatsi. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Ino sambi ho tuna mivili jino ja muinyi, tun'guta kwa wusungu na kukodeka. Siyo kuta tun'gana kuguwopola muvili guno gwa kufwa, lechelelo tun'gana kufikwa muvili gula gwa wumi go sinambe gufwe, ili muvili guno gwa kufwa gusumwe na gula go sinambegufwe. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Mulungu mwene yo atuvichye ndongwa itso, nayo atupelye Muhe vake ili twihuvile kuta ndongwa tsila tso atuvichye iho hambele tsa wukweli.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Ihyo lelo siku tseka tunkuva na lihuvilo na tuntsela kuta ho tungikala mu muvili guno tun'kuva kutali na Mutwa, <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />kwasawuli tungikala kwa litumbilo na siyo kwa hila fyo tunlava hela. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Lechelelo tunawo wukangatso, duve yikakuva chiba tuguleche muvili guno gwa muinyi na kubita kikala na Mutwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ihyo kaha manyi tuve iha mu muvili guno awu tuve nago kutali, chinu cho tunguchigana kuchidita cho chila cho anguchigana Mutwa. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Hetwe tweka tun'ganika kwima halutalo ha chigoda cha Chilisito ili tuhigwe nayo, na chila munu ahombwe kwajili ya ndongwa tso adisile ho avaga na muvili guno, tsive tsa wuwuya awu tsive ntsibi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kihantsa na Mulungu kwa kukolela kwa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Hetwe tuntsela kuta Mutwa an'ganika kuhesimilwa, na ihyo tunkangala kuvakwega vanu vanji. Mwene Mulungu angulutsela lulongwa ulu bila lufiho na heni tsingihuvila kuta na henye mungututsela kwa nachene bila wufiho. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Siyo kuta tun'gana tujele kuvadita mutudichilwe, lechelelo tun'gana mulole chila cho tungidayila henye, ili muvajibule vanu vala yo vangidutsila hila fyo van'woneka hila fyovali hela. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Manyi tun'woneka kuta tuna chijeni, yinkuva kwasawuli ya Mulungu. Ino manyi tunatso nyala, yinkuva kwasawuli yenyu, <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />kwakuva wugano wa Chilisito wo wungutulongotsa, ino tungitumba kuta munu yumwe afweye kwasawuli ya vanu veka, na ihyo tun'tsela kuta vanu veka tufweye mu chifo chake. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Chilisito afweye kwasawuli ya vanu veka, ili vanu veka wo wumi valeche kikala kwasawuli ya vene, ila vikale kwasawuli ya mwene yo afweye na kutsilipulwa kwasawuli yawo.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Duve, luhuma sambi hetwe sinambe tumuhije munu hila fyoali kwa kumulava hila fyoali hela. Nayivaje luvala lumwe twamuhitsile Chilisito hila fyoali kwa kumulava mwivala hela, lechelelo sambi sinambetudite chinya ihyo kota hamutalo. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Ihyo manyi hala munu yoyuve ihantse kwa Chilisito an'kuva munu mupya, ndongwa tsa katali tsinkuva tsilutye na ntsin'kwantsa ndongwa ntsipya. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Ndongwa itso tseka aditaga mwene Mulungu, yo atupatanisaga hetwe na mwene kwa kukolela kwa Yesu Chilisito. Nayo Mulungu yo atuvisile hetwe ili tuve vajumbe va kuvapatanisa vanu na mwene. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ihyo tunlonga kuta, Mulungu avaga mugati mwa Chilisito ili avapatanise vanu va inyi tseka na mwene, bila kutsilava ndongwa ntsibi tso vavaga vadisile. Nayo atupelye hetwe katsi ya kuvalonjela vanu vihantse nayo.<verse eid="2CO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Ihyo hetwe tutumilwe na Chilisito kuyikola katsi yake, nayo Mulungu anguvafunda henye kukolela kwa hetwe. Hetwe natwe kwasawuli ya Chilisito tunguvagongola ndalahela ili mupatane na Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Chilisito siavaga na ndongwa ntsibi, lechelelo Mulungu amudisile awoneche ana ndongwa ntsibi kwasawuli ya hetwe, ili hetwe tudite kota fyo an'gana Mulungu kukolela kwa yula yo amuhangwe.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Hetwe tunkola katsi hamwe na Mulungu, ihyo tunguvagongolani kuta mulekaje kululeka lusungu lo mwanuchye kuhuma kwa Mulungu luyaje hihinago hela. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Mulungu avaga alontsile kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">“Luvala lwa kidichilwa, ntsakuhulikitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:2">na luvala lwa wukuluso, ntsakutantsile.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Duve, Ulu lo luvala lwa kudichilwa, na ino lelo yo siku ya kukuluswa!<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Hetwe mu katsi yetu sinambetumwambutse ikuvatse munu yoyuve, tun'dita ihyo ili wutantsi wetu kwa Mulungu wuleche kubedalwa na munu yoyuve. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Ila mu chila lulongwa tupate ntsumitso nofu, kota fyo yiganikaga yive kwa vatantsi va Mulungu, twikangatse mu fivembo na mung'alatsi na mu ng'odeko. <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />Twatofilwe na kuwopwa mu nyumba tsa vawopwa, mu fitika na mu katsi nalamu, na kikala miho, na kwa kuva na ntsala. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Tungilajila kuta tuli vatantsi va Mulungu kwa kudita hila fyo an'gana mwene, mu ntselo na kwa kikangatsa, mu wuwuya na kwa Muhe va Mulungu, na kwa wugano wa wukweli, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />kwa kulonga ndongwa tsa wukweli na kwa kihuvila wuvetso wa Mulungu wo wakolaga katsi hamwe na hetwe. Wuwuya wo chitovelo chetu cha kututanga kwiyamila na kwitovela. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Hetwe tungumutumichila Mulungu nayivaje vanu vangutuhesimila awu vangutubedala, vatutsumile awu vatulonje fibi. Tun'woneka kota tuli vadesi kumbe tuli vanu wo tunlonga wukweli, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />tunkuva kota vanu wo sivatambulwa kumbe tuli vatambulwa, kota vanu wo vankufwa na kumbe tuli wumi, tuntowa lechelelo sinambetufwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Tun'kuva kota vanu vasusutafu, lechelelo siku tseka tun'sangalala. Tun'woneka vagayu na kuno tunguvadita vanu wolofu vave vafuchifu, tukuva kota vanu wo tulihela chinu kumbe tunafyo finu fyeka.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Vang'olotsetu Vakolindo, tunlonga na henye bila kuvafiha chinu chochive kuno tunguvagana nachene. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Hetwe situlesile kuvagana henye, ila henye wo mulesile kutugana hetwe. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ihyo lelo ntsinlonga henye kota vana vangu kuta mun'ganika mwigane kota hetwe fyo tunguvagana.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuleka kihantsa na vanu wo sinambevamutumbe Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Mulekaje kihantsa hamwe na vanu wo sinambevamutumbile Mulungu. Mbe, wuwuya na wubi fifuluche fihanje? Mbe, mwangatsa gufuluche gwihatse na jitsa? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Mbe, kuna wupatano wachi hagati ha Chilisito na Lihoka? Munu yo amutumbye Mulungu ana wihantso wachi na munu yo sinambeamutumbe Mulungu? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Mbe, kuna wihantso wachi hagati ha Nyumba ya Mulungu na milingu ja wudesi? Kwakuva hetwe tuli Nyumba ya Mulungu yo mumi. Kota mwene Mulungu fyo alontsile kuta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">“Ngikala hamwe nawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">na ngujendasa hamwe nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">nguva Mulungu vawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:16">nawo vakuva vanu vangu.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Kaha Mutwa Mulungu an'wila kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">“Muwuche hagati hawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mwibagule nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">mulekaje nambe kudometsa chinu cho chikudita ndeche kuvadichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:17">na heni nguvanuchila.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Nguva Dada venyu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">na henye mukuva vana vangu valume kwa vahintsa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 6:18">Heni Mutwa Mulungu munya wuvetso weka yo ntsinlonga ihi.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Ino lelo vang'olotsangu, kwasawuli tunafyo fila Mulungu fyo avaga alontsile kuta akutupela, sambi tun'ganika tufileche finu fyeka fyo finchafula mivili na numbula tsetu, ili twikale nachene kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wuhechelelo wa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Tunguvasuka mutugane, kwasawuli hetwe situlapungana na munu yoyuve hagati henyu, kaha situmudisile munu yoyuve ayaje, nambe kumutsulumula munu yoave. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Sinambendonje ndongwa itsi ili tsivahije henye, ila kwasawuli tsavaga ntsivalonje luhuma hamutalo kuta nambe ku wumi nambe mu chifo, hetwe tunguvagana henye nachene. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ntsinalyo litumbilo likomi hala ho ntsinkuva ntsinlonga na henye na tsinguvahuvila. Mu ng'odeko tsetu tumemile lihuvilo na kumema wuhechelelo wukomi ndalahela.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Hala hotwavaga kufika ku Machedoniya, situkesye. Twagatswaga chila lubali, mwivala mwetu mwavaga na ng'odeko, na munumbula twavaga na muhwehwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Lechelelo Mulungu yo avakangatsaga wo vagotswe, atukangitse hala ho avaga kutsa Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Siyo kutsa kwa Tito hela ko kwatukangitse, ila na kwa tsila ndongwa tso mwamulonje kuta fyo mun'gana mumbone heni na hila fyo munsusutalila ndongwa tso tsamasile. Kaha hila fyo mun'gana kunanjila heni ili wuhechelelo lwangu wuve wukomi kulutila fyo wavaga luvala loluve.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Nambe ntsavadisile muve na wususutalo kwa kuvandichila baluva yila, ila sinambe ng'alale. Nambe na heni ntsasusute luvala ludodo hela, ila ntsatselaga kuta baluva yangu yavapelye wususutafu wo wawaga wa luvala ludodo hela, <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />lechelelo sambi ntsina wuhechelelo, siyo kwasawuli mwapasile wususutalo, ila kwasawuli wususutalo uwo wuvadisile kutsihala ndongwa tsenyu ntsibi na kumupituchila Mulungu. Ihyo mwasusute kota fyo aganaga Mulungu na ihyo hetwe sitwavadisile mukodeche kwa lulongwa loluve. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Kwakuva wususutafu kwa Mulungu wumuditaga munu kutsihala ndongwa tsake ntsibi na kumupituchila mwene na kukuluswa, kaha wuletaga wukuluso na wulihela ng'alatsi. Lechelelo wususutafu wo wunkwambutsa na ndongwa tsa muinyi wuletaga chifo. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ino lelo mulave hila wususutafu wo aletaga Mulungu fyo wavapelye fwayida mugati mwenyu, sambi muveye vanu wo kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu. Mun'kola ndongwa kwa wukangatso, na kwipamana, na kuwuvipila wubi, na kumuhesimila Mulungu, na kugana kumbona, na kaha mun'gana ndongwa tseka tsiditwe kwa wuwuya. Henye mwilaje kuta muna wuwuya kwa chila lulongwa.<verse eid="2CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Nambe ihyo ntsalongwe kuvandichila baluva yila siyo kwasawuli ya yula ng'ani yo avaga adisilile wubi awu kwa yu yo avaga adisilwe wubi. Lechelelo ntsavandichye ili mulave muvene halutalo ha Mulungu, hila fyo mwitawe kwasawuli ya hetwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ihyo twahongitswe ndalahela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Kaha kwa kuhongetswa uko twahechelye ndalahela hala ho twavaga kumuwona Tito hila fyo avaga na wusangalo, kwasawuli ya hila fyo mwamudisile asangalale. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ntsavaga ntsivatsumye kwa Tito, na henye simungwisise ndaya. Kota hila fyo twamulonje wukweli na kitsumila halutalo hake kwasawuli ya henye, nayo iwen'ye mwene kuta sitwavaga tumudetelitse. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Ihyo wugano wa Tito kwa henye wunlutila ndalahela hala fyo ankwiwuka hila fyo mwamuhulikitsaga, na hila fyo mwamwanuchilye kwa kukakama. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Heni Pawulo ntsinhechelela ndalahela, hila fyo ntsinguvahuvila henye nachene kwa chila chinu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Kutawula kwa wugano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Duve vang'olotsetu, ntsin'gana kuvalonjela lula lusungu lwa Mulungu lo chapelitwe fikundi cha vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fya ku Machedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Vanu va uko vakolye njelo ntsolofu na ng'odeko, na kuva mu wugayu, lechelelo wusangalo wawo wavaga wulutye na vavaga vadeche ndalahela. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ino ntsinguvalonjelani kuta vavaga valutye wudeche kulutila hila fyo vaganikaga kitawula, nawo vatawe finu kwa kugana vene, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />na vatugongwe ndalahela ili tuvadichile vihantse mu katsi yino ya kuvatanga vanu wo vahagulwe na Mulungu va ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Hetwe sitwihuvilaga kuta vakudita ihyo! Hawulongolo vitawe vene kwa Mutwa, kahi vakitawulaje kwa hetwe kota hila fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ihyo twamugongolitse Tito, kwasawuli mwene yo alwantsitse lulongwa ulo lwa wuwuya, ili avatanje kuyidita katsi iyo ya wugano hagati henyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Kota hila fyo mulivalongola kwa chila chinu, na mu litumbilo, na mundonga. Mulongwe mu litumbilo na wuvetso wa kulonga, mu ntselo na wuwuya weka na mu wugano wenyu kwa hetwe, hihyo tun'gana mulutile ndalahela mu lusungu luno lwa kuva vatawulaji.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Sinambentsivagwagwaditse, lechelelo ntsin'gana kuvalajila hila vayenu vanji fyo vangikangatsa kuvatanga vanu vanji, ili ntsele hila wugano wenyu fyowuli. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Henye munguwutsela wuwuya wo avapelye Mutwa Yesu Chilisito kuta mwene nambe iho hamutalo avaga chibopa, ila kwasawuli ya henye idisile ave mutsunwa ili kwa wutsunwa wa mwene henye muve fibopa.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ichi cho ntsin'gana kuvalonjela, kuta mun'ganika kudita kota fyo mwadisile mwaka go gwalutye. Henye mwavaga valongola siyo kutawula hela, ila mwavaga na chimuhemuhe kudita lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Duve lelo muyidite katsi yino kwa chimuhemuhe kota fyo mwayidisile hamutalo na kutawula kota fyo mukuvetsa. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Manyi munu ave na numbula ya kutawula, Mulungu akwanuchila chila choan'vetsa kutawula, nayo Mulungu siamudayaga chila munu choalihela.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Heni sinambengane kuta henye mukodeche ili vanu vanji vahechelele, ila tun'gana nyeka mwihwane. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Luvala luno ho munafyo finu fyolofu mun'ganika kuvatanga vayenyu, ili nawo hovakuva na finu fyolofu vavatanje na henye. Ihyo ho nyeka mukihwana, <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />kota fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yandikwe mu chitabu cha Kuhuma 16:18 hala ho vatutaga fila filyo kubalali.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">“Munu yula yo atutite ndalahela siapasile filyo fya hachiba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 8:15">na yula yo atutite fidodo siagayile filyo.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tito na vayage van'tumwa ku Kolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ntsingumulumba Mulungu yo avisile mu numbula ya Tito lusungu lwa kuvatanga henye kota hila heni fyo ntsavatangaga. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Siyo kuta Tito idichye hila fyo twamulajitse hela, ila atsitse kwenyu kuno avaga na chimuhemuhe kulutila luvala loluve, na kaha atsitse uko kwa kugana mwene. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Nahetwe tungumutuma Tito hamwe na mung'olotsetu yumwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Litawa lya munyalukolo uyu sinambe litambulwe, na kaha mu musitali gwa 22 kuna litawa lyo sinambe litambulwe.</char></note> yo anhesimilwa na fikundi fya vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito kwa katsi yake ya kuvavikulila vanu Ndongwa Nofu. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kulutila ihyo, fikundi fya vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fyamuhagwe ili ajendase hamwe na hetwe hala hotukuva tunsindika sadaka yino ya wugano ya kuvatanga vayetu, sadaka yo twatawe kwasawuli ya wuvina wa mwene Mutwa ili kulajila kuta tun'gana kuvatanga.<verse eid="2CO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Tun'gana munu yoyuve aleche kutulonganga fibi kwasawuli ya lulongwa luno lwa kwimilila sadaka ya kuvatanga vayetu. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Tun'gana kudita wuwuya siyo halutalo ha Mutwa hela, ila na halutalo ha vanu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Hamwe na vanu iwo wo tuvatumile, tungumutuma mung'olotsetu yunji yo tumujetsitse mala ntsongofu na kumuwona kuta ana chimuhemuhe cha kuvatanga vanu, na kaha sambi an'gana kuvatanga hilo kwasawuli analyo lihuvilo likomi kwa henye. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Manyi munu an'gana kutsitsela ndongwa tsa Tito, uyo Tito mung'olotsangu na tunkola katsi hamwe kwasawuli ya henye. Lechelelo kwa ndongwa tsa iva vang'olotsetu vanji yo vatsitse hamwe nayo, iwo vatumilwe na fikundi fya vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito. Nawo vangumutsumitsa Chilisito! <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Ihyo mun'ganika muvalajile iwo vang'olotsetu kuta henye muna wugano, ili fikundi fya vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito fitsele chila chotungitsumila kwa henye.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="s">Kuvatanga vafwasi va Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Sintsin'ganika mbwile kuvandichila hila fyo mun'ganika kuyidita katsi yino ya kuvatanga vayenu va ku Yelusalemu wo vahagulwe na Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Kwasawuli ntsintsela hila fyo mungiwiniwa kuvatanga, na heni ntsidutsitse kwa lulongwa ulo kwa vanu va ku Machedoniya. Ntsavalonje, “Vang'olotsetu va ku Akaya valichang'ani kuhuma mwaka go gulutye.” Ihyo hamu yo munayo yivadisile vanu wolofu nawo van'gana kutawula. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Nambe lelo ntsivatumile vang'olotsetu iwo Tito na vala vayage vavili ili kwidutsa kwetu kuleche kuva ndonga hela, ihyo lelo muvaje chang'ani kota fyo mwalontsile kuta mukuva chang'ani. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Yilekaje kuva kuta hala honguvakutsa na vanu va ku Machedoniya ntsivafiche simulichang'ani, na ihyo hetwe tukuwona nyoni kwasawuli twavaga twitsumye kwa henye, na henye mukuwona nyoni. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ihyo mbwene kuta yin'ganika ntsivalonjele iva vang'olotsetu valongole kutsa uko, ili vaviche chang'ani mipanjo ja sadaka iyo yo mwalontsile. Ihyo yikuwoneka kuta sadaka iyo muntawula kwa kugana henye na siyo ya kuvagwagwaditsa hetwe hela.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Mwihukaje kuta mulimi yo ayalaga nyadikwa ndodo uyo abetaga filyo fidodo, nayo yo ayalaga nyadikwa ntsolofu abetaga filyo fyolofu. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Chila munu atawulaje kota fyo an'gana munumbula yake, siyo kwa kukalala awu kwa kugwagwaditswa hela, kwasawuli Mulungu amuganaga munu yoantawula kuno numbula yake yigolwiche. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Nayo Mulungu akuvapela henye kulutila fyo mun'gaya, ili chila luvala muve na chila chinu cho munguchigana, na ihyo mulutile kuvatanga ndalahela vanu mu katsi tsa wuwuya. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Kota hila fyo yandikwe mu mandiko ga Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">“Mwene agavasise fifunje fyake kwa wuwuya na kuvapela vagayu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2CO 9:9">wuwuya wake wikalaga siku tseka bila wudugo.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Uyo Mulungu yo amupelaga mulimi nyadikwa ya kuyala na chilyo cha kulya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yandikwe mu chitabu cha Isaya 55:10 kuta Mulungu amupelaga mulimi nyadikwa na chilyo.</char></note>, na hihyo akuvagavasila na kuvalutitsila na henye nyadikwa tsenyu tsa kuyala na kaha akutsotetsa na kutsikalagatsa, na kudita mubete filyo fyolofu kwasawuli ya uwo wuwuya wenyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Nayo Mulungu akuvadita muve vafuchifu kwa chila chinu ili muve vanya lusungu chila luvala, ili kukolela kwa henye mwene alumbwe kwasawuli ya fifunje fyo mwaboche kuhuma kwa hetwe. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Katsi yino yo munguyidita siyo kuta yinguvapela vanu vahagulwa va Mulungu finu fyo fin'ganika hela, ila kuvadita vanu wolofu vamulumbe Mulungu ndalahela. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kwa katsi yo munguyidita bila kugwagwaditswa, vanu vakumutsumitsa Mulungu kwasawuli ya wudikitso wenyu wo wulihamwe na wuwuya wenyu kwa kihala Ndongwa Nofu ya Chilisito, na kwa wuwuya wenyu wo munguvalajila vene hamwe na vanu veka. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Ihyo lelo kwa lulongwa ulo vene vakiwiniwa na kuvasuchila kwa Mulungu kwa wugano hilo, kwasawuli ya wuwuya uwo wa wiyeka wo avapelye Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Tungumulumba Mulungu kwasawuli ya chifunje chake chino cho situfuluche tuyihadise hila fyo yin'ganinika.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo anguwamila wutantsi wo anguwudita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Heni Pawulo ntsinguvagongola kwa wudeche na wuwuya wake Chilisito, heni yo mbaga munu va kwika hala ho ntsinkuva hamwe na henye, lechelelo ng'alipaga hala ho ntsinkuva kutali na henye! <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ntsinguvagongola muleche kundita ntsive mukali iho ho nguvakutsa, kwasawuli ntsinhotsa kuta fuluche ntsive mukali kwa vanu veka wo vanhotsa kuta tungikala kota vanu vanji va muinyi fyo vikalaga. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Nayivaje kuta tungikala muinyi, lechelelo sinambe twitove ligalu kota fyo vitovaga vanu va muinyi, <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />kwasawuli fitovelo fyetu siyo tsa chiwunu, ila fina wuvetso wa Mulungu nambe kugwisa ng'antsi ngatsi tseka na kwananga mahotso geka ga wudesi, <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />na kugwisa mahotso mabi na chila chinu cho chinkwinuka tebe na ntselo tsa Mulungu, na kugakwegwesa mahotso gawo mabi na kuvadahitsa vamuhulikitse Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Tukumuhiga chila munu mudadambafu hagati henyu, hala ho mukuva chang'ani kumuhulikitsa Chilisito kwa chila chinu.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Henye mutsilave ndongwa tsotsili mwivala hela. Manyi kuve na munu yoyuve yo angitumba kuta mwene munu va Chilisito, uyo an'ganika kwiwuka kuta na hetwe tunakota mwene. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Nayive mufuluche kumbona kuta ndutilitse kidutsa kwa wuvina wo amelye Mutwa, nayo atupelye wuvetso ili tuvakangatse na siyo tuvatetse, na ihyo lelo heni sinambembone nyoni kwa hila fyontsin'dita. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ntsin'gana muleche kuhotsa kuta ntsin'jela kuvakabusa kwa baluva tsangu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Munu afuluche alonje kuta, “Baluva tsa Pawulo ng'ali na nalamu, lechelelo mwene ho ankuva hamwe na hetwe ankuva alichaka hela, nambe na ndongwa tsake tsinkuva mefu hela.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Munu kota uyo atselaje kuta ndongwa tso tunkwandika mu baluva, yo tsotsitso tso tunkuva natso hala hotunkuva hamwe na henye.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Yive fyoyili, hetwe situfuluche tuve likuga limwe awu kihwananitsa na vanu vala yo vangidutsa vene. Vanu wo vangidita kuta vene wo chipimilo na wo vangihwananitsa vene kwa vene, na kwakudita ihyo vangilajila kuta van'dita ndongwa tsa chipufi. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Lechelelo hetwe situfuluche twitsumile kulutila hila fyo yin'ganika, ino lelo tukitsumila kota fyo atugavye mwene Mulungu na katsi yo tunguyikola nambe kwa henye. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Sitwatsufile mbaka tsa kitsumila hala ho twatsaga kwa henye, kwasawuli hetwe wo twalongwe kutsa kwenyu kuvaletela Ndongwa Nofu ya Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ino lelo sinambetwitsumile kwa katsi tso vadisile vanu vanji, ila tungihuvila kuta litumbilo lyenyu linkwendelela kukalagala, nayo katsi ya hetwe kwa henye yikwendelela kugatsuka kwa kudita kota fyo an'gana Mulungu. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ihyo ho tukuvetsa kuvikula Ndongwa Nofu ku inyi tsinji tsa kutali na henye ko kuduhu munu yo ankola katsi uko. Kwasawuli tulema kitsumila kwajili ya katsi yo yidisilwe chang'ani na munu yunji.<verse eid="2CO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Lechelelo kota fyo galongaga Mandiko ga Mulungu, “Mwene yo angitsumila, itsumilaje kwa katsi tso adisile Mutwa.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yandikwe mu chitabu cha Yelemiya 9:24 </char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Munu yula yo idichilwaga na Mutwa, avaga siyo yo angitsumila mwene, ila yula yo an'tsumilwa na Mutwa.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo na vatume va wudesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ntsinwiniwa mukamuntsindile chidogo, na yivaje tsinwoneka mupufi chidogo! Ena, muntsindile chidogo. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ntsinguvamila kota hila Mulungu fyo anguvamila. Kwasawuli henye munakota mwenga munofu yo siamutsele mulume, yo ntsamukwelye mulume yumwe hela, na mulume uyo yo Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Lechelelo ntsin'kogopa kuta, kota hila Efwa fyo adetelitswe kwa wusugu na yila ntsoka, nago mahotso genyu nago gafuluche gapitulwe na mulamule kuwuleka wugolofu wenyu wa wukweli kwa Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Mun'woneka kuta muli chang'ani kumwanuchila munu yoave manyi atse na kuvavikulila yesu yunji tebe na yula Yesu yo twavavikulye hetwe. Kaha mun'woneka muli chang'ani kumwanuchila muhe yunji tebe na yula Muhe yo mwamwanuche, awu kwanuchila ndongwa tso tsinji tebe na Ndongwa Nofu yo mwanuche hamutalo.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Sinambentsihotse kuta ntsili mudodo kulutila iwo wo vangichema, “vatumi vavina.” <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Yifuluche yive heni sintsifitsele kulonga finofu, lechelelo kusoma ntsasomile vaya! Lulongwa ulo twalulaje bila lufiho na chila hono kwa chila luvala.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Mbe, ntsadisile fibi kwika ili ntsivinule henye kwa kuvavikulila Ndongwa Nofu tsa Mulungu bila kunyomba chinu chochive? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Hala ho ntsakolaga katsi ya wutumi hagati yenyu, ntsatangwaga na fikundi finji fya Chilisito. Ntsavaga kota ntsinguvasukula vene magobole ili ntsivatanje henye. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Hontsavaga hamwe na henye sintsamukodite munu yoyuve kwa kumusuka magobole, kwasawuli vanu vanya litumbilo lya Chilisito wo vahumye ku Machedoniya vandetye chila chinu cho ntsagayaga. Ntsiyangalilaga ili ndeche kuvagatsa, nambe sambi ngwendelela kudita ihyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Kuduhu munu yoyuve va ku Akaya yino yeka yo afuluche andemetse kidayila lulongwa luno, ntsinguvalonjela ihyo kwasawuli wukweli wa Chilisito wuli mugati mwangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Kwasawuli yachi ntsinlonga ihi? Mbe, sinambentsivagane henye? Nambe mwene Mulungu antsela hila fyo ntsinguvagana!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Heni ngwendelela kudita hihyo kota fyo ntsin'dita sambi, ili kuvadita vala wo vansaka hila fyo vakuva kota hetwe vagotsole, vala wo vangidutsa kuta vankola katsi kota hetwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Vanu kota iwo wo vatumi va wudesi, vankola katsi chinya wusugu na wo vangibadila ili vawoneche kota vatumi va Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Lulongwa ulo siyo lupya, kwasawuli nambe Lihoka lyene libadilaga ili liwoneche kota mutantsi va mwangatsa. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Ihyo silukuva lulongwa lupya, manyi iwo vatantsi vake nawo vibadile na kuva vawuya halutalo ha Mulungu. Ino lelo ku wudugo vakuchipata chila cho chihwana na ndongwa tso vatsiditaga.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pawulo anlonga ndongwa tsa ng'odeko tsake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ntsinlonga kaha kuta munu alekaje kuhotsa kuta heni ntsili mupufi. Lechelelo nambe munyotsela chinya ihyo, duve muntsanuchile kota mupufi ili na heni ntsidutse chidogo. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Chila cho ntsinlonga sambi kwa lulongwa luno lwa kidaya siyo chila cho andajitse Mutwa, ntsinlonga kota munu mupufi hela. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ihyo vanu wolofu vangitsumila kota vanu vala va muinyi fyo vaditaga, hihyo na heni ngitsumila. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Vanu henye muna nyala ntsongofu ndalahela, hila fyo mungidikitsa kuva hamwe na vanu vapufi! <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Mungidikitsa kuva hamwe na munu nambe yo anguvadita muve vapogotsi, na ave anguvasukula finu fyenyu, awu anguvasindamitsa, na ave munu anguvatsalawula na kuvatsabulanga kumiho! <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ntsin'wona nyoni kulonga ndongwa tsino,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Lechelelo na hetwe twavaga vapefu kudita ndongwa kota itso! Nambe yive fyoyili, na manyi kuve na munu yoave yo afuluche itsumile chinu, “Ntsinlonga kota munu mupufi!” Heni ntsingitsumila kwa lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Mbe, vene wo Vayebulaniya? Na heni hihyo. Mbe, vene wo Vaisilaheli? Na heni hihyo. Vene vahumye mu lulelo lwa Ibulahimu? Na heni muyawo ntsili hihyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Mbe, vene wo vatantsi va Chilisito? Lelo ntsinlalatuka kota mnyalukwale, heni ntsivalutye veka! Heni ndisile katsi ngomi kulutila veka, ng'odiche ndalahela, funtsilwe mu nyumba tsa vawopwa ndalahela, nofilwe mala ntsongofu, kaha ng'ulwiche kukopolwa mala ntsongofu kulutila vene. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ntsatofilwe jila mikotya ja Chiyawudi salasini na tisa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Icho cho chavaga chitowo cho chigaya malanga yaganikaga jive mikotya alubayini. Ihyo yo vakosise vatowagwa mikotya salasini na tisa ili guleche kulutila nambe gumwe bila kutsela. Lave mu chitabu cha Wihuko 25:3</char></note> mala kahanu. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ntsatofilwe mikotya ijo ja Chilumi mala kadatu, ntsatofilwe kwa maganga mala kamwe, ntsakuluche mumalenga kwasawuli mitumbwi jabenekaga mala kadatu, ntsakite miho mu malenga molofu chilo cheka na munyi yeka, <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />chila luvala mu njendo tsangu ntsakulukaga na ng'oko tsa mumalenga na tsa vawumiyani, na mu ng'oko tsila tsa Vayawudi vayangu na tsinji kuhuma kwa vanu wosi Vayawudi, ntsakulukaga na ng'oko tsa ku mujini na tsa kijejele, ntsakulukaga mubahali na tsa kuhuma kwa vafwasi va wudesi. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Mbeye mu katsi nalamu na ya kukodeka, kikala miho mala ntsongofu, ntsikalaga na ntsala na ng'alu na kuleka kulya kwasawuli ya Mulungu mala ntsongofu, kaha na kutowa na ng'ala na kugaya nambe mwenda gwa kigubika hela. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kulutila ndongwa itso tseka, ntsavaga na mbomolo ngomi ya kufimilila fikundi fyeka fyo vingumutumbila Chilisito. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Manyi munu ave chaka na heni mbaga chaka. Manyi munu amwambutse muyage adite ndongwa ntsibi, na heni mbonaga fibi.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Manyi yikun'ganika ntsitsumile, duve ngitsumila kwa ndongwa tso tsinlajila wupefu wangu. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Mulungu na Dada va Mutwa Yesu yo an'ganika kutsumitswa siku tseka, uyo yo antsela kuta heni sinambendonje wudesi. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Hala ho ntsavaga ku Damesichi, muvina yo avaga mu wuntsajila wa muntsajila Aleta, avisile vimilitsi mu lwitsi lwa muji ili vambate. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Lechelelo ntsakuluche kwa kuvikwa mu litangula likomi na kuntsisa mu lidilisa lya mu lukantsi lwa muji.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Nduntsuchilo na wugubulo wa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ntsin'ganika ntsitsumile na yivaje siyo finofu. Ila ngihala tsila nduntsuchilo na wugubulo wo amelye Mutwa. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ntimutsele munu yumwe hino yo avaga angumutumbila Chilisito, munu uyo myaka kumi na jitayi jo jilutye avaga achipulwe kilanga ndalahela. Manyi avaga mu muvili, awu avaga mu chimuhe heni sinambentsele, ila Mulungu mwene antsela. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Ntsilonga kaha, heni ntsimutsele munu uyo, lechelelo sinambe ntsele kuta manyi avaga mu muvili, awu avaga mu chimuhe, ila Mulungu mwene antsela, <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />munu uyo achipulwe mbaka ku Paladiso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilanga kwa Mulungu ho hono hanofu ndalahela.</char></note> Uko akahulikaje ndongwa tso siafuluche munu atsilonje. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Fuluche ntsitsumile kwasawuli ya munu kota uyo, lechelelo sifuluche ntsitsumile ntsimwene, ino heni ngitsumila wupefu wangu. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Manyi ntsive ntsin'gana kitsumila sintsikakuva mupufi, kwasawuli ntsika kuvalonjela wukweli. Lechelelo sinambentsitsumile hila fyo yin'ganika ili munu yoyuve aleche kutsela kuta na heni ntsili munu hagati ha vanu.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Lechelelo ili ndeche kitsumila kwasawuli ya uwo wugubulo wukomi wo ntsawuwene, ngapelwaje wusungu mu muvili gwangu guve kota mwifa, ugo go jumbe va Lihoka netseche ili ndeche kitsumila. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ihyo ntsamugongwe Mutwa mala kadatu ili anyetsele ng'odeko itsi. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Lechelelo mwene Mutwa akandonjelaje, “Wuwuya wangu wo ngupelye wukukwilye, kwasawuli wuvetso wangu wuwonekaga kwa munu mupefu.” Kwasawuli iyo ngitsumila kwa wuhechelelo ndalahela kwasawuli ya wupefu wangu, ili wuvetso wa Chilisito wikale na heni. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ihyo lelo ntsingidichila kuva mupefu, na kuligwa, na kubedalwa, na ng'odeko kwasawuli ya Chilisito. Kwasawuli hala ho ntsinkuva mupefu, iho ho ntsinkuva na wuvetso.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhwehwe gwa Pawulo kwa Vakolindo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Mbeye kota mupufi na henye yo mundatsimitse ntsive ihyo. Henye yo muganikije muntsumile heni, nantsive heni sintsili chinu, ila siyo mupefu kulutila vala wo vangichema “Vatumi vavina.” <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Hontsavaga kwa henye ntsikangatsaga, na ntsaditaga ndongwa tsa ndajilo na miwujitsa natso tsandaje kuta heni yo mutumi va wukweli. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Mbe, chinu chachi cho mwagayite kulutila fikundi finji fyo fingumutumba Chilisito? Ila heni kwa lubali lwangu si ntsavakodile munyudumile? Manyi muwone kuta ng'osise, duve nyongitse ntsiyenu kwa kuleka kuvaditila ihyo.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Lelo ntsili chang'ani kutsa kwenyu mala ya kadatu, lechelelo si nguvakoda. Heni sinambesache finu fyenyu, ila ntsinguvasaka henye, kwasawuli siyin'ganikaga vana kuvavichila valeli vawo hachiba, ila valeli vavavichilaga vana vawo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Ihyo heni nguva chang'ani kufitawula finu fyangu ili fitumilwe na henye, nambe kitawula heni mwene kwa fwayida ya numbula tsenyu. Mbe, hala ho ntsinlutila kuvagana, henye ho mukuleka kungana?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Nayive fyoyili, mukidichila kuta heni sintsavakodile. Lechelelo munu afuluche alonje kuta, “Kwasawuli Pawulo musugu akuva avapatite kwa kuvadeteletsa.” <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Mbe, munu yoyuve yo ntsamutumile kwenyu, ntsamulajitse avahombetse chinu chochive? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ntsamugongwe Tito na kumulajitsa hamwe na mung'olotsetu yunji. Mbe, Tito avahombitse chinu chochive? Mbe, sinambemutsele kuta hetwe tunlongotswa na Muhe yuyulaga, na katsi yetu yoyimwe?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Mbe, munhotsa kuta tungiyamila tu vene halutalo henyu? Lechelelo hetwe tunlonga halutalo ha Mulungu kota fyo van'ganika kudita vanu yo vangumutumbila Chilisito. Vang'olotsangu mutsele kuta chinu chochive cho tunguchidita, tunguchidita ili kuvakangatsa henye. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ntsinkogopa kuta hala hongutsa fuluche ntsivafiche kota hila fyo sintsin'gana kuvafika, na ihyo heni nguganika kuwoneka finji kwa henye. Ntsinhotsa kuta mufuluche muve na ng'alatsi, na mbafya, na lilakali, na wusonganitsi, na wuhehi, na kidutsa, na kisova, na chitika. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ntsinkogopa kuta ihyo honguva kutsa kaha kwenyu, Mulungu afuluche andite ntsiche, na ihyo nguvavembela wolofu wo vadisile ndongwa ntsibi na kuleka kumupituchila Mulungu kwa ndongwa tsawo tsa wubi, na kiwiniwa kuvasa na valume awu vadala vanji, na ndongwa tsa waafu tso vatsidisile.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Pawulo ansinda kwa kuvafunda na kuvasamusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ulu lo luvala lwa kadatu heni kutsa kwa henye. Mandiko ga Mulungu gandikwe hino, “Chila lulongwa ho lunkuva lunlamulwa, han'ganika have na vanu vavili awu vadatu wo vatsiwene na kutsihulika ndongwa itso.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Mwanga ntsavalonje hala ho ntsavaga na henye mala ya kavili. Kaha ntsin'wila kulonga ho ntsili haduhu, honguva kutsa singuvawonela lusungu vala wo valongwe kudita ndongwa ntsibi na hamwe na vanu vanji. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Nguvalajila hila Chilisito fyo anlonga kukolela kwa heni. Chilisito siyo mupefu kwenyu, ila anawo wuvetso hagati henyu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Nambe yivaje avambitwe mu musalaba chipefu hela, lechelelo sambi ali mumi na angikala kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu. Hetwe natwe tuli vapefu kota hila Chilisito fyo avaga, lechelelo hala ho tungitang'ana na henye tunkuva tuli wumi hamwe nayo ili tuvatumichile henye kwa wuvetso wa Mulungu.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mwihime mu vene mulave kuta mungumutumba Chilisito. Mwilave mu vene! Mbe, sinambemutsele kuta Yesu Chilisito ali mugati mwenyu? Manyi yive siyo ihyo, mukuva mulemulwe duve kuva hila fyo mun'ganika muve! <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Ntsingihuvila muntsela kuta hetwe silwatulemulwe lulongwa ulo. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ila tungumusuka Mulungu kuta mulekaje kudita lulongwa lubi loluve, siyo kuta hetwe tuwoneche tulusumile lulongwa ulo, chotuhotsa kuta vanu vawone kuva mudisile lulogwa lunofu. Nambe tuwoneche kuta hetwe tulemulwe lulogwa ulo. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Hetwe situfuluche tusumane na wukweli, lechelelo chila luvala tun'dita ndongwa tsa wukweli. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Tunhechelela hila fyotuli vapefu, lechelelo henye munawo wuvetso. Kaha tungumusuka Mulungu kuta avakangatse mu litumbilo lyenyu kota fyo an'gana mwene. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ino lelo ntsivandichye baluva yino luvala lo ntsili kutali, ili ho nguvakutsa ndekaje kuva mukali kwa wuvetso wo amelye Mutwa. Mutwa amelye wuvetso wa kuvatsenga na siyo kuvagumulanga.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Duve lelo, vang'olotsangu mwikalaje finofu. Mwikangatsaje mu litumbilo, mwibataje hila fyo ntsivalonje, muvaje wo vamwe na kikala kwa wusichimafu. Nayo Mulungu munya wugano na wusichimafu weka akuva hamwe na henye.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Mwisamusaje kwa kinonela henye kwa henye!<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Vanu veka va Mulungu wo valikuno vanguvasamusa.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ntsinguvasuchila lusungu lwa Mutwa Yesu Chilisito, na wugano wa Mulungu, na wuhantso wa Muhe va Mulungu wuve na henye nyeka.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>